{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinthesis is a top-down, isometric, 2D shooter roguelike, where you shoot your way through waves of enemies in order to descend deeper into an underground laboratory. Hack your gun to unlock new weapons, and steal chemicals that can induce mutations that, if chosen wisely, could change the game for the better.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As of right now, only the demo is available. In the full release, there will be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 26 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More mutations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary special effects for each weapon when you complete an unlocked password</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to be notified of the full release.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008270?t=1766958211","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008270/48b49ba789296f615db34e8123e9e6973389b0e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766958211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008270/71a146369842587c8fcaa1e1573b2a6e05d624ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766958211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008270/71a146369842587c8fcaa1e1573b2a6e05d624ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766958211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4026820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinthesis is a top-down, iso